[SPEAKER_05]: And then, when Satipuṭṭha, I think that he is the main protagonist in this sutta, explains what unwholesome is, he says, killing of living beings, taking what is not given, and so on and so forth, and he ends with, end wrong view.

348
00:34:05,577 --> 00:34:11,419
[SPEAKER_05]: And then, when he says what is wholesome, he says not killing living beings, not taking what is not giving, and the right view.

