00:34:11,879 --> 00:34:13,660
[SPEAKER_05]: So, the problem here is obvious.

350
00:34:14,020 --> 00:34:22,603
[SPEAKER_05]: So, you want to know what the right view is, and the answer is you have to understand the wholesome and the unwholesome, and when you define the wholesome and the unwholesome, you define it by

