00:34:24,443 --> 00:34:26,483
[SPEAKER_05]: mentioning the right view and the wrong view.

352
00:34:26,864 --> 00:34:36,306
[SPEAKER_05]: So, you have to have the right view in order to be able to understand the right view, which is a clear example of circularity, which is, of course, problematic.

353
00:34:36,326 --> 00:34:36,966
[SPEAKER_05]: There are several.

354
